  "description": "Innovasia is the official annual hackathon organized by the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Vasavi College of Engineering, Hyderabad. Participants get an opportunity to innovate and develop solutions across diverse technology domains. Eligibility: Open to all undergraduate students currently enrolled in any college or university. Inter-college teams: Allowed. Inter-specialization teams: Allowed (teams can include members from different fields of study). Team size: 2–4 members. All members must meet the eligibility criteria. Registration and Fee: Preliminary round: No registration fee. Only shortlisted teams need to pay Rs. 800/- per team by 3rd November 2026. Online registration deadline: 30th October 2026 EOD. Themes: 1) Fintech 2) Cybersecurity & Blockchain 3) Smart Automation 4) Agriculture, Food and Rural development Problem Statements will be released on 26th October, 2026. Participants need to select any one problem statement and submit ppt according to the template given. All participants must strictly adhere to the provided template. Presentations that deviate from the template will be disqualified.",
